    <briefdescription>
<para>This class provides an abstraction for a timeout around an operation that must complete in a given amount of time. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Failure to complete before the timeout is an unrecoverable situation and no mechanisms to attempt to handle it are provided. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
